            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>摩根士丹利(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:MS:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/MS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">MS-US</a>)截至台北時間21日03:30股價下跌8.86美元，報166.12美元，跌幅5.06%，成交量5,616,633（股），盤中最高價173.40美元、最低價166.11美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-1.43%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-3.14%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-4.5%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-9.62%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>摩根士丹利(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:MS:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/MS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">MS-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：-4.23%</li> <li>近 1 月：+1.51%</li> <li>近 3 月：-15.43%</li> <li>近 6 月：-4.44%</li> <li>今年以來：+2.05%</li></ul></section></main>",
